                ><div class="iTPQPoA4j9t9pCM3J" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text imSRQSnyYzDh8Zg6Y"><h2>360° Rotation</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iRT1hTsr4pbd34xB0"
                    ><p>No more awkward leaning—360° rotating seats spin smoothly towards you, making buckling your little one simple, even in smaller cars or tight parking spaces. A game changer if you have back pain or plan on extended rear-facing. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="instant-editor__link" href="https://www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk/collections/rotating-car-seats">Shop all our rotating car seats.</a></p></div
                  ></div
                ></div
              ><div class="iqES7MoPKefkJJNo4" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="media" class="ijpRevc1YIjAUz5QC"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/pA7N7eNuv1IdnSi6/slidetech.webp?width=1280" width="1080" height="1080" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
                ><div class="iFTlQ8G6S6xmdrfpI" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text imBwHh4FxzIWKMdjN"><h2>SlideTech</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i4blJPlnq6TTZMOiB"
                    ><p>Say goodbye to awkward lifting. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="instant-editor__link" href="https://www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk/blogs/b4baby/introducing-maxi-cosi-360-pro-family-line">Maxi-Cosi’s SlideTech</a> lets you easily slide your car seat onto the ISOFIX base from the side—quick, secure, and effortless every time. Ideal for smaller cars or anyone wanting extra reassurance. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="instant-editor__link" href="https://www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk/collections/car-seats?filter.p.m.custom.brand_collection=Maxi-Cosi+SlideTech%E2%84%A2">Shop all SlideTech car seats.</a></p></div
                  ></div
                ></div
              ><div class="icBPpXaknxLNJEXz9" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="media" class="ikYDQsd0jezv9rnfN"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/ohvhmhZEABz5T6jo/lie-flat.webp?width=1280" width="1080" height="1080" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
                ><div class="iUfyyyq5EAtlC2MLn" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iiIEtX7dbmPQaGu8e"><h2>Lie-Flat</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iQVeViY81gsuCvVup"><p>Lie-flat car seats let your newborn travel in a natural, healthier position, protecting their delicate spine and helping them breathe easily. Perfect if you take long drives or want added peace of mind for your little one’s comfort.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
