          ><div data-instant-type="media" class="iV4ejaHHOAHRolzrs"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/B9MeZpwIBeZyTSHS/adac-kindersitze-2021-test-3480x480.webp?width=1280" width="480" height="480" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
          ><div class="iVpCsd8bhq9VDnfBS" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="ipDsMAKVg49lTKfUX" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div class="iFpbs3KqcKvuoZKS0" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iiis9SAe8lEdbulkx"><h2>ADAC</h2></div></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ig02Rsj5gxKtg4s5M"
                ><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="instant-editor__link" href="https://www.adac.de/rund-ums-fahrzeug/ausstattung-technik-zubehoer/kindersitze/kindersitztest/">ADAC</a> is one of Europe’s most respected car seat safety tests. It goes above the legal minimum, assessing crash safety, ease of use, comfort, and even the seat’s materials. A low ADAC score means the seat has been thoroughly tested in real-world conditions—perfect if you want an extra level of confidence in your choice.</p></div
              ><a class="i2GsM2xNXsGmpV1u0-i5TF0yOzccA4Bh2M" data-instant-type="container" href="https://www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk/blogs/b4baby/adac-what-does-it-mean" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iqNFbmh6e8G5VEDCR-i5TF0yOzccA4Bh2M"><p>LEARN MORE ABOUT ADAC</p></div></a
              ></div
            ><div class="immEE2k1hDGqXiaXv" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div class="iU2wj7aasvSx47aHk" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iJasTZmfl4M8qtVnK"><h2>Swedish Plus</h2></div></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iDpdusizuASZ1FiAJ"><p>The Swedish Plus Test is the strictest crash test in the world—and only rear-facing car seats can pass it. It measures how well a seat protects a child’s neck in a serious head-on collision. If you’re planning to keep your child rear-facing for longer (which experts recommend), this test is your ultimate safety marker.</p></div
              ><a class="i2GsM2xNXsGmpV1u0-k3k3YOliAN4aetHW" data-instant-type="container" href="https://www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk/blogs/b4baby/what-is-the-swedish-plus-test" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iqNFbmh6e8G5VEDCR-k3k3YOliAN4aetHW"><p>LEARN MORE ABOUT SWEDISH PLUS</p></div></a
              ></div
            ></div
          ></div
        ></div
      ></div
    ><div class="ir9KwJDeKf1P2tXFH" data-instant-type="container" id="ir9KwJDeKf1P2tXFH"
      ><div class="iKpnIfmoTcJyYsDEO" data-instant-type="container"
        ><div class="i11jI7JjetWJg72wj" data-instant-type="container"
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ijWdJCR3HWEC0Abkz"><h1>i-Size car seats explained</h1></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iSRJyVYYMWSh3p0oJ-vVbHEAhzWai5wpcV"
            ><p><strong>i-Size </strong>is the newest European car seat safety standard (also known as <strong>R129</strong>) designed to make car seats even safer, simpler, and more universal. You can think of i-Size as an updated version of the older R44/04 standard. It&apos;s not yet compulsory, but it&apos;s fast becoming the preferred safety standard.</p></div
          ></div
        ><div class="iWhs5F86xIwE0rKay" data-instant-type="container"
          ><div class="iVEV8gom8uMOcIfXn" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="i5PqTBDoZPcFPa3WJ" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div class="iJBnGpgCZEGun6B17" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="media" class="ifvGZApYfp3sQOboc"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/2VIspZ25LqR5plrz/besafe-go-beyond-lifestyle-84615c1f3-691b-48b2-8191-221d6d5682a0.webp?width=1280" width="720" height="720" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
                ><div class="i41NrUo0FOz1q4xrQ" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text inNcWf63C6P1jGb27"><h2>Height Based Sizing</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ikYA2UB1BOt6jzQzm"><p>Instead of choosing a seat based on your child’s weight, you choose based on their height. This makes it much easier to get the right fit for your child as they grow.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div class="i8UURsKlYLXBAbwBB" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="media" class="iWMb12aKhXxWFLZM0"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/Zz1gw45s8F1e73Rv/nuna-pipa-urbn-lifestyle-5b96987ec-a56e-48b1-9e3d-c262c80fb8701.webp?width=1280" width="540" height="540" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
                ><div class="iU9rm0lTb8f0iHW3F" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ikCmgpk93H3dcjpCh"><h2>ISOFIX Installation</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iXB0mhbOmkDlK7a3j"><p>Most i-Size seats use ISOFIX points for simpler, safer installation. Many also come with indicators to confirm the seat’s fitted correctly.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div class="iI4cxz9ak1xUQSkPb" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="media" class="iIVT7oTWUNuBIB6O2"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/SvvI0TzTYeRbRkV7/maxi-cosi-pearl-360-car-seat-lifestyle3718eadd-109c-4f98-9c10-bb779b460576.webp?width=1280" width="1080" height="1080" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
                ><div class="iOpbXRxGPZZDMJH2U" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iQSXq5E48eLGKY3DE"><h2>Extended Rear-Facing</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text if2hl6XWXZbX5QFT5"><p>With i-Size, babies must stay rear-facing until they’re at least 15 months old—but ERF is strongly recommended until around 4 years for maximum safety.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ><div class="iEHAkdLB2iZkflDtG" data-instant-type="container"
                ><div data-instant-type="media" class="iihUSCE4Fb8RDIpMM"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcSet="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=1080 1080w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=828 828w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=750 750w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=640 640w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=360 360w, https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=1280 1280w" src="https://cdn.instant.so/sites/XoayiDWI6O31eqEo/assets/7dLNz1GYBqQhn26E/britax-advansafix-lifestyle-3.webp?width=1280" width="720" height="720" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" class="instant-media instant-image instant-image__main"></div
