                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text is0ZXuOlCTmZthrp8"><h2>Side Impact Testing</h2></div
                  ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iAXYyx8l0WI1wU0gS"><p>All i-Size seats undergo mandatory side-impact crash testing, ensuring your little one has extra protection if a collision happens from the side.</p></div></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
