        ><div class="iyvQ2tS2Ay6cIFpjm" data-instant-type="container"
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iQ8LEkjBl1CNQ1Sot"><h1>Do I need an i-Size seat?</h1></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iSRJyVYYMWSh3p0oJ-X0Dc6UE8NqwAaq3R"><p>Legally, you can still buy and use seats tested to the older R44/04 standard. But if you’re shopping for your first car seat, choosing an i-Size seat is a smart choice for peace of mind, thanks to its enhanced safety standards. Plus, with height-based sizing, it takes away any guesswork about when to move your child up to the next seat.</p></div></div
        ><a class="i2GsM2xNXsGmpV1u0-6CDnVWUIwkwcojc2" data-instant-type="container" href="https://www.naturalbabyshower.co.uk/collections/i-size-car-seats" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
